{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy management and sim games with indirect control, I'm creating this one for you. Especially if you're tired of harsh sci-fi colonies or endless underground mines. Greenfeet Haven offers a softer, more peaceful take on the genre, inspired by RimWorld's depth and Stardew Valley's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/extras/f842b77e497b9fe8fd29fec194e73c05.gif?t=1762514239\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/extras/f842b77e497b9fe8fd29fec194e73c05.poster.avif?t=1762514239\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you can do</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops and cook food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build houses, warehouses, and workshops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items in the research system. What happens if you mix a stick and some straw?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to expand the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade goods with other civilizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design zone-based automation for your growing town</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important note from the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm developing Greenfeet Haven solo. This project is a passion of mine, and I want to take the time to make it feel right. The plan is to launch in Early Access with a solid core experience, then grow the game together with player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like chill, thoughtful management games, I hope Greenfeet Haven can become a place you'll enjoy spending time in.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2791310?t=1762514239","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2791310?t=1762514239","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762514239","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762514239","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3547670,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy management and sim games with indirect control, I'm creating this one for you. Especially if you're tired of harsh sci-fi colonies or endless underground mines. Greenfeet Haven offers a softer, more peaceful take on the genre, inspired by RimWorld's depth and Stardew Valley's atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/extras/f842b77e497b9fe8fd29fec194e73c05.gif?t=1762514239\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/extras/f842b77e497b9fe8fd29fec194e73c05.poster.avif?t=1762514239\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you can do</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow crops and cook food</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build houses, warehouses, and workshops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine items in the research system. What happens if you mix a stick and some straw?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore to expand the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade goods with other civilizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design zone-based automation for your growing town</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important note from the developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! I'm developing Greenfeet Haven solo. This project is a passion of mine, and I want to take the time to make it feel right. The plan is to launch in Early Access with a solid core experience, then grow the game together with player feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like chill, thoughtful management games, I hope Greenfeet Haven can become a place you'll enjoy spending time in.</p>","developers":["Owlycode makes games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2791310/header.jpg?t=1762514239","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2791310/830569/ccf385b1f3ab7486c8ec2ca869c3d70fb45a529e/1750900527/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739807647","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2791310/830569/ccf385b1f3ab7486c8ec2ca869c3d70fb45a529e/1750900527/dash_h264.mpd?t=1739807647","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2791310/830569/ccf385b1f3ab7486c8ec2ca869c3d70fb45a529e/1750900527/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1739807647","id":257099342,"name":"Gameplay footage","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257099342/6b95d1f179896d29fb96777a2976c5e8d045f2bf/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739807647"}],"name":"Greenfeet Haven","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core 2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</str